name: Whole repository retains exclusions; explicit inclusion keeps old plans intact
size: 120x36
cwd: @TMP_TARGET
env-unset: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY KUZUSHI_MODEL KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE NODE_OPTIONS NO_COLOR
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/scope_inclusion.py @TMP_TARGET @ART seed @TMP_HOME
require-wrapper-flow:
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
submit: options sast:scan
submit: set taskMode manual
submit: set tasks secret-scan
submit: scopes
require-live-snap: 30 DRAFT SCOPES | initial-boundaries
expect: Excluded · 1
keys: Enter Down Down Down Down Down Down Down
require-live-snap: 20 exclusions stay recorded. | whole-action
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 30 r2 | whole-keeps-exclusion
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/scope_inclusion.py @TMP_TARGET @ART whole
expect: Whole repository · 2 files
expect: Excluded · 1
keys: Down Down f
require-live-snap: 25 server/router.rs | excluded-membership
ask: Does changing to whole-repository coverage retain the explicit exclusion and show its omitted file, without approving discovery?
resize: 160x48
live-snap: exclusions-160x48
resize: 96x89
live-snap: exclusions-96x89
resize: 80x24
live-snap: exclusions-80x24
resize: 60x20
live-snap: exclusions-60x20
resize: 40x12
live-snap: exclusions-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: exclusions-page-1-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: exclusions-page-2-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: exclusions-page-3-40x12
resize: 120x36
keys: Escape
require-live-snap: 15 Uncovered 0 · excluded 1 · overlap 0 | files-closed
keys: Home a
require-live-snap: 20 Accept exact boundaries | exclusion-acceptance
keys: Enter End Enter
require-live-snap: 30 Action stopped | missing-exclusion-acknowledgement
keys: Home Down Down Enter End Enter
require-live-snap: 30 ACCEPTED SCOPES | first-acceptance
keys: Home p
require-live-snap: 30 PLAN A STUDY | first-study
keys: L
require-live-snap: 30 Draft ready | first-plan
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/scope_inclusion.py @TMP_TARGET @ART first-plan
keys: Escape
require-live-snap: 20 ACCEPTED SCOPES | back-to-scopes
keys: Enter End Up Enter
require-live-snap: 20 Exact recorded exclusion path | inclusion-form
expect: server/router.rs
keys: C-u
type: missing.rs
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 30 Action stopped | invalid-path-preserved
expect: missing.rs
ask: Is inclusion deliberate and reversible, with the current path/reason visible and invalid input kept for correction?
keys: C-u
paste-file: @ART/include-path.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 30 r4 | included-draft
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/scope_inclusion.py @TMP_TARGET @ART included
expect: Whole repository · 3 files
expect: Excluded · 0
keys: p
require-live-snap: 20 Accept the exact scope revision | unaccepted-work-refused
keys: a
require-live-snap: 20 Accept exact boundaries | renewed-acceptance
keys: Enter End Enter
require-live-snap: 30 ACCEPTED SCOPES | accepted-inclusion
keys: Home p
require-live-snap: 30 PLAN A STUDY | second-study
keys: L
require-live-snap: 30 Draft ready | second-plan
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/scope_inclusion.py @TMP_TARGET @ART second-plan
keys: Escape
require-live-snap: 20 ACCEPTED SCOPES | second-plan-return
keys: Escape
require-live-snap: 20 options[sast:scan] | scopes-closed
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 NO_COLOR=1
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
submit: scopes
require-live-snap: 30 ACCEPTED SCOPES | restarted-scopes
expect: Whole repository · 3 files
expect: Excluded · 0
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/scope_inclusion.py @TMP_TARGET @ART second-plan
ask: After no-color restart, does the new accepted scope remain separate from the original plan/report and its exclusion, with zero discovery jobs or provider calls?
keys: Escape
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
